1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
The signal is repeating. I have never seen this pattern before.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,200
Check the frequency logs from last night. Compare them with the offshore buoy data.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,800
If the correlation holds, we need to alert the mainland relay station.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,000
This is beyond standard interference. Someone is sending these pulses deliberately.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,300
The window closes in three hours. We do not have the luxury of waiting for confirmation.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,500
Then we trace it ourselves. I will call the team.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The reply window opens at 23:00. Be ready.
